From: Aryan Gahlot <aryangahlot50@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 10:55:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] phase-5: swarmengine — correlation graph and split-privilege detection

Implements a time-bounded in-memory graph over the NATS JetStream audit log.
Detects split-privilege data exfiltration across multiple agents (SEC-09).

Refs: SEC-09, Master Spec 3.6
